  (text "DUAL-CHANNEL 12-BIT 10 MSPS USB DIGITIZER\nSignal path: BNC (1 Mohm, scope-probe compatible, +/-10 V) -> AFE_A/AFE_B (div/20, FET buffer, FDA) -> LTC2290 dual ADC\n -> iCE40HX4K FPGA -> 16 MB SDRAM capture buffer (0.1 s needs 4 MB) -> FT2232H sync FIFO -> USB 2.0 HS (USB-B).\nPower: USB bus powered, ~370 mA est. (< 500 mA, so USB-C/PD not required). Analog/ADC rails enabled after enumeration.\nCross-sheet digital nets use global labels; AFE<->ADC use hierarchical pins."
    (at 30.48 172.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "09160144-460b-46c8-9ae2-6b1474781bde")
  )
)
